eam to win every match in its group. Spain had been runner-up at the 2020 Tokyo Games, as well as at three of the last five editions of the World Championships. Both teams won their quarter-final games, but then Australia shocked spectators by edging past the Americans in a penalty shootout. The Australians would ultimately go on to lose the final to Spain 11-9, but the Dutch team offered a final surprise by defeating the United States 11-10, meaning that the American women missed the podium for the first time in Olympic history."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button347101", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button347101').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Goals/Saves"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Shot %"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Natural Action Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Centre Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Driving Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Extraman Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "6-metres Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Penalty Shot Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Counter-Attack Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Turnovers", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TOV"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Steals"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Rebounds", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TRB"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} 